{"id":"634593","name":"小麦胚芽馒头","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/634593/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"高筋粉","amount":"250g"},{"name":"奶粉","amount":"20g"},{"name":"小麦胚芽","amount":"30g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"高糖酵母","amount":"3g"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1枚"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"高筋粉、奶粉、糖、酵母、牛奶、鸡蛋混合。","img":"images/634593/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"拌成絮状。","img":"images/634593/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再加入小麦胚芽。","img":"images/634593/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成面团。","img":"images/634593/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"分次加入玉米油。","img":"images/634593/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"揪成面块，就像扯橡皮泥。反复操作此步骤。","img":"images/634593/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"最后揉成面团。","img":"images/634593/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"静置发酵。","img":"images/634593/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/634593/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"分成等分。","img":"images/634593/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"取一份擀成饼。","img":"images/634593/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"卷成卷。","img":"images/634593/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"再擀成薄饼。","img":"images/634593/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"三分之一处叠被子。","img":"images/634593/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"叠被子。","img":"images/634593/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"继续叠被子。","img":"images/634593/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"还叠。","img":"images/634593/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"擀成薄片刷油。","img":"images/634593/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"再次叠被子。","img":"images/634593/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"像这样。","img":"images/634593/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"再这样。","img":"images/634593/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"最后一下。","img":"images/634593/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"擀薄刷油。","img":"images/634593/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"卷成卷。划几刀。静置发酵30分钟。进蒸锅冷水起锅，水开蒸15分钟。关火焖两分钟开盖子。","img":"images/634593/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/634593/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"松软麦香。","img":"images/634593/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"颜色淡黄。","img":"images/634593/step_27.jpg"},{"step":28,"desc":"这个面也可以进烤箱180度烤35分钟。面包具体操作，可以参照上一个“小麦胚芽面包”菜谱。","img":"images/634593/step_28.jpg"},{"step":29,"desc":"一起吃馒头吧！","img":"images/634593/step_29.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}